{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_08935","headline":"宣州长史弟昭赠余琴谿中双舞鹤诗以见志 · 李白","name":"宣州长史弟昭赠余琴谿中双舞鹤诗以见志","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"令弟佐宣城，赠余琴谿鹤。\n谓言天涯雪，忽向窗前落。\n白玉爲毛衣，黄金不肯博。\n背风振六翮，对舞临山阁。\n顾我如有情，长鸣似相托。\n何当驾此物，与尔腾寥廓。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李白","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_08935.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_08935","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}